title: "three.ws: a browser platform for 3D AI agents"
abstract: "Open-source platform for embodied 3D AI agents in the browser: text-to-3D generation, rigged avatar creation and animation retargeting, an embeddable agent-3d web component, and Model Context Protocol servers."
